    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just a bad mood or a rough patch. it's more like... the actual substance of my life is gone. like the colors have all bled out and left just grey. i look at my work, my life, and i just see a hollow shell. there's no \"getting through\" this because there's nothing left to get back to. it's just dragging a heavy, empty weight around forever.",
